d) Non pecuniary loses : 15,00,000/- in words (Fifteen Lakhs only) for loss of amenities, on account of injury the deponent may not be able to walk, run or sit;
damages for the loss of expectation of life, i.e. on account of injury the normal longevity of the person concerned is shortened, inconvenience, hardship, discomfort,
disappointment, frustration and mental stress in life.
